# ============================================================
# SUMMARY STATISTICS
# ============================================================
# Total entities:
#   - 5 people (each with a GitHub and an Infoscience platform profile)
#   - 10 platform profiles
#   - 1 research project (3 members, 4 outputs, host org + funder)
#   - 4 organizations
#   - 3 repositories
#   - 6 articles
#   - 15 contributions
#   - 8 memberships
#   - 3 parent repositories
# 
# Contributor overlap:
#   - Alice Chen: all 3 repos + 4 articles + 2 memberships
#   - Bob Kumar: repos 1,2 + 3 articles + 2 memberships + repo ownership
#   - Carol Martinez: repos 1,3 + 2 articles + 1 membership
#   - David Lee: repos 2,3 + 2 articles + 1 membership
#   - Emma Wilson: repo 3 + 2 articles + 2 memberships
#
# Organization overlap:
#   - EPFL ComputationalLab: repos 1,3 + 3 people + 2 articles
#   - Swiss Research Alliance: repos 1,2 + 1 person + 2 articles
#   - DepartmentPhysics: repo 3 (via unit) + 1 person + 1 article
#   - PhysicsSimulationUnit: repo 1 (parent) + 1 person
# ============================================================
